// Generated by scripts/stdcorpus from Go's unicode package and strconv.IsPrint, on every Unicode scalar value: the counts of each Rune class per plane of 0x10000 code points, the sum of the UTF-8 lengths, and a hash of Go's ToLower, ToUpper and ToTitle; against Rune.is_letter, is_digit, is_space, is_print, is_upper, is_lower, is_title, is_punct, is_control, is_graphic, is_mark, is_symbol, is_number, utf8_len, to_lower, to_upper and to_title, plus the boundaries and the values Rune.try rejects (Go's unicode is Copyright 2009 The Go Authors, BSD-style license) (go1.26.1).
// Do not edit: regenerate with go run ./scripts/stdcorpus.

